<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-chenshu" book-id="b-chenshu-028" chapter-id="c-chenshu-028-shenjunli-two-princes" source-id="s-chenshu-028-shenjunli-two-princes-ws2581394">
  <p id="c-chenshu-028-shenjunli-two-princes:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">始興王<persName id="c-chenshu-028-shenjunli-two-princes:p001:m0003" ref="5ye_fwj_neh_D">伯茂</persName>字<persName id="c-chenshu-028-shenjunli-two-princes:p001:m0006" ref="5ye_fwj_neh_D">鬱之</persName>，<persName id="c-chenshu-028-shenjunli-two-princes:p001:m0009" ref="5ye_fwj_neh">世祖</persName>第二子也。</p>
  <p id="c-chenshu-028-shenjunli-two-princes:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">三年，除鎮東將軍、開府儀同三司、東揚州刺史。</p>
  <p id="c-chenshu-028-shenjunli-two-princes:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">長沙王<persName id="c-chenshu-028-shenjunli-two-princes:p003:m0003" ref="icd_mkz_d9n_D">叔堅</persName>字<persName id="c-chenshu-028-shenjunli-two-princes:p003:m0006" ref="icd_mkz_d9n_D">子成</persName>，<persName id="c-chenshu-028-shenjunli-two-princes:p003:m0009" ref="icd_mkz_d9n">高宗</persName>第四子也。</p>
</text>
